<title>POLAND: Budimex unit wins PLN 14.2 mln tender.</title>
<headline>Budimex unit wins PLN 14.2 mln tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Budimex Poznan, a subsidiary of Polish construction firm Budimex SA, won a tender worth 14.2 million zlotys for the second stage of the building of a shopping mall in Poznan, Budimex said in a statement.</p>
<p>Work on the project in the western Polish city must be completed by February 15, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
